{"version":1,"content":"<p>成軍40年的日本長青樂隊SPITZ，早前為影后蒼井優主演的話題劇《直至T恤乾透》唱主題曲。</p><p>樂隊將於下周三推出相隔3年半的全新專輯《kettle》，令樂迷非常期待。</p><p>不過，隊中59歲鼓手崎山龍男日前卻不幸發生車禍，重傷入院。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:11:15.257327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:10:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T03:04:39.348763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:04:39.348763+00:00","content_hash":"08bac146dc0155931a3d5e0c6b2052b10b607e3a688f22925b10fe4014a9c90a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}